        271.67
      ],
      "text": "comparisons."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.44,
        275.5,
        499.73,
        287.14
      ],
      "text": "In the group insertion method, in order to insert an element αk, we perform"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88,
        284.8,
        499.73,
        300.57
      ],
      "text": "at most log(2k + m) + O(log−1/5 n) = log(2k −1) + O(log−1/5 n) comparisons"
